#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libgedit-amtk"
msgstr "Instalação do libgedit-amtk"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libgedit-amtk</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libgedit-amtk</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:92
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir amtk-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    amtk-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..              \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"      -D gtk_doc=false      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir amtk-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    amtk-build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..              \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release   \\\n"
"      -D gtk_doc=false      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>.  One test, test-"
"action-map, is known to fail."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Um teste, "
"test-action-map, é conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/libgedit-amtk.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D gtk_doc=false</parameter>: This switch prevents the build "
"system from generating and installing the API documentation. Omit this "
"switch if you have <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and "
"wish to generate and install the API documentation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D gtk_doc=false</parameter>: Essa chave impede o sistema de "
"construção de gerar e instalar a documentação da API. Omita essa chave se "
"você tiver o <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar "
"gerar e instalar a documentação da API."

